---
import PreviewPane from './PreviewPane.astro';
---
<section data-owner-posts class="owner-grid">
  <aside class="owner-sidebar panel"><div class="owner-section-heading"><h2>文章架</h2><button type="button" data-post-new>写新文章</button></div><div data-post-list></div></aside>
  <div class="owner-workspace panel">
    <p class="message-kicker" data-editor-state>写新文章 · 仅自己可见</p>
    <div class="owner-view-tabs" aria-label="写作视图"><button type="button" data-editor-view="edit" aria-pressed="true">编辑</button><button type="button" data-editor-view="preview" aria-pressed="false">预览</button></div>
    <div class="owner-editor-columns" data-editor-columns data-editor-view-mode="edit">
    <form data-post-form method="post">
      <label for="post-title">标题</label><input id="post-title" name="title" maxlength="200" required />
      <label for="post-description">一句话简介</label><textarea id="post-description" name="description" rows="2" maxlength="500" required></textarea>
      <div class="owner-field-pair"><div><label for="post-date">文章日期</label><input id="post-date" name="pubDate" type="date" required /></div><div><label for="post-tags">标签</label><input id="post-tags" name="tags" placeholder="生活，学习" /></div></div>
      <details class="owner-details"><summary>文章网址</summary><label for="post-slug">网址末尾</label><input id="post-slug" name="slug" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*" maxlength="100" required/><p>用英文小写、数字和短横线。发布后尽量保持它不变，别人收藏的链接才不会失效。</p></details>
      <div class="owner-section-heading"><label for="post-body">正文</label><button type="button" data-image-choose>插入图片</button><input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp" data-post-image hidden/></div>
      <textarea id="post-body" name="body" rows="18" maxlength="200000" data-post-body placeholder="把想留下来的文字写在这里。可以直接粘贴 Markdown。"></textarea>
      <p class="owner-small-note">Markdown 可以写标题、引用、列表、链接和代码。图片会随这篇文章一起公开或收起来。</p>
      <div class="owner-actions"><button type="submit" data-post-save>保存草稿</button><button type="button" data-post-preview>看看预览</button><button type="button" class="message-submit" data-post-publish>发布文章 →</button><button type="button" data-post-unpublish hidden>收回为草稿</button><button type="button" class="owner-danger" data-post-delete hidden>删除文章</button></div>
      <p class="owner-small-note" data-editor-dirty>保存后只有你能看见；点击发布才会出现在网站上。</p>
    </form>
    <PreviewPane/>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
